      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s railroad camp moved south in 1881, and the Kansas City‑Fort Scott‑Memphis line was finished two years later, sparking early settlement.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
